Copyright 2026 Mike Bannister

This crate is built inside a fork of herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It compiles the following
herdr source files unmodified, by path, from the enclosing checkout:

  src/detect/manifest.rs
  src/detect/manifests/*.toml
  src/pane/agent_detection.rs

The `agentstate` shim modules (`config`, `detect/mod.rs`,
`detect/manifest_update.rs`, `terminal.rs`), the `tracker` module, the
command line, and the tests are original work in the herdx workshop
(https://github.com/possibilities/herdx), also under Apache-2.0.
`detect/manifest_update.rs` reproduces herdr's `ManifestVersion` type
verbatim so version comparison keeps herdr's semantics.
